    "Molecule 5 contains a provenance conflict between brigatinib (C21) and GSK1322322 (C50, C20); conflicting cards were discounted.",
    "Molecule 8 provides only qualitative 'excellent' bioavailability without a numeric value, so it is not threshold-decisive.",
    "Molecule 1 includes a wide interindividual range (7-82%) and some qualitative 'low' reports, but the strongest ordinary-condition numeric records remain >=20%."
  ],
